{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tsarevna is an action game where grace and fury merge into one. As a young princess, you will take up a sword and embark on an unpredictable journey, challenging the mythical creatures that have taken over the world. But the key to victory lies not in brute force, but in the elegance and precision of your movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/616\u0445250.gif?t=1747130307\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deadly Grace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is a ballet, where steps, jumps, and sword swings merge into a single flow. Dodge, attack, parry, and chain smooth combos, turning every fight into a devastating performance. Each movement is a deadly art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/616\u0445250\u04452.gif?t=1747130307\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Legend You Will Write</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mystery-filled story awaits you, inspired by the works of one of the greatest 19th-century writers, Alexander Pushkin. It\u2019s an engaging, heroic, yet touching tale that blends deconstructed fairy tales and an interpretation of Slavic mythology through the lens of dark fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/616x250x4.gif?t=1747130307\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Secrets of the Forgotten Lands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A breathtaking world lies before your feet. Explore numerous locations and overcome the challenges that arise on your path. Each new territory is a mystery for you to solve. But keep in mind, you're accompanied by the cunning cat Bayun, which means you must be ready for anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Edge of Tsarevna</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel between the world of the living and the world of the dead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Close the rifts, eradicating traces of dark forces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete the trials of the Aspid idols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the form of a dark swan and change the course of battles</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3348640?t=1747130307","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/9803395cf525a55d0532288aa32959b821865bf5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747130307","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/69383f12df0149da9b5f292b7b99b479832e6575/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747130307","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/69383f12df0149da9b5f292b7b99b479832e6575/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747130307","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tsarevna is an action game where grace and fury merge into one. As a young princess, you will take up a sword and embark on an unpredictable journey, challenging the mythical creatures that have taken 